Package: aracne.networks
Type: Package
Title: ARACNe-inferred gene networks from TCGA tumor datasets
Version: 1.39.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Federico M.", "Giorgi", email = "federico.giorgi@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7325-9908")),
    person("Mariano J.", "Alvarez", email = "reef103@gmail.com",
        role = "aut"))
Description: This package provides access to ARACNe-inferred gene
    regulatory networks (regulons) from TCGA tumor datasets. The networks
    are hosted on Zenodo, downloaded on demand and cached locally with
    BiocFileCache. The package also contains a function to export them
    into plain-text format.
License: file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/federicogiorgi/aracne.networks
BugReports: https://github.com/federicogiorgi/aracne.networks/issues
biocViews: ExperimentData, Genome, Homo_sapiens_Data, CancerData
NeedsCompilation: no
Depends: R (>= 4.0), viper
Imports: BiocFileCache, tools, utils
Suggests: BiocStyle, knitr, rmarkdown, testthat
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Encoding: UTF-8
